  "text": {
    "en": "Release of 2026-11-09: Core CPI YoY (ex food and energy) 2026-10 0.8% (prior 1.0%); PPI YoY 2026-10 5.7% (prior 5.0%); PPI MoM 2026-10 0.7% (prior 1.2%); PPI, consumer goods YoY 2026-10 -0.1% (prior -0.1%); CPI YoY 2026-10 0.7% (prior 0.9%); PPI, producer goods YoY 2026-10 7.4% (prior 6.5%). No preregistered evidence test changed outcome on this release; since the judgment in force (2026-10-04-baseline.yaml, 2026-10-04) the changes are: T-H1-01 false→true, T-H1-05 false→true, T-H2-03 true→false, T-H2-04 false→true. Across all tests, 10 currently read in favour of the thesis and 9 against it (H0, the supply-led explanation, counted against). Terminal status ACTIVE. Proposed: no change to the thesis; probability stays 30%, conviction LOW, status ACTIVE.",
    "zh": "2026-11-09 发布：扣除食品和能源价格后的核心CPI同比 2026-10 0.8%（前值 1.0%）；工业生产者出厂价格指数同比 2026-10 5.7%（前值 5.0%）；工业生产者出厂价格指数环比 2026-10 0.7%（前值 1.2%）；PPI生活资料同比 2026-10 -0.1%（前值 -0.1%）；居民消费价格指数同比 2026-10 0.7%（前值 0.9%）；PPI生产资料同比 2026-10 7.4%（前值 6.5%）。本次发布没有预注册证据检验改变结果；相对现行判断（2026-10-04-baseline.yaml，2026-10-04），检验变化为：T-H1-01 false→true、T-H1-05 false→true、T-H2-03 true→false、T-H2-04 false→true。全部检验中，目前 10 项支持命题、9 项不支持（H0 供给主导解释计为不支持）。终止状态：进行中。建议：命题判断不变；概率维持 30%，信心低，状态进行中。"
